    </p>
    <p>
      A pathology or diagnostics lab scales through repeat testing volume and can add locations without adding your own hours. A retail pharmacy scales through steady turnover and staff you hire. A physiotherapy clinic scales once you can bring on a second therapist. Even a plain BSc Biotechnology graduate can raise their own ceiling meaningfully with a genuine MSc plus a bioinformatics or lab-automation skill layered on top.
